  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "World Building and Avatar creation are the two biggest draws to vrchat.\n\nMany worlds and avatars have been made but the people who make them are scattered.  Its hard to find people to talk about world and avatar creation with, its more about who you know in order to find other creators.\n\nA good way to support  the building community is to give them a place to meet up and chat.  An official world simply so the existence of that world is not in the hands of an uninvolved third party.\n\n\nSo I suggest make two official rooms one called something like the World Builders Room and the other the Avatar Builders Room.  Each room contains some tools and items to help with that discussion.\n\nOne thing I suggest is this.  In order to stop the rooms been filled with people who are either not involved with the building community or there to bother builders by inundating them with requests these two rooms should only be available to those who have uploaded 1 world and/or 1 avatar to access each room.  It does not matter if they uploaded them private just that they made the effort to upload something.\n\nAs anyone can upload worlds and avatars it is not making the rooms unavailable to everyone just to those who have taken the effort to actually make something.",
